{
  "name": "dsh-dzdrone-ssh",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "在 dsh 里操作 dzdrone 无人机（NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano）：侧栏图标进入无人机面板，可自由切换 VNC 桌面（通用 VNC 连接器：自带 noVNC，一键走插件网桥直通无人机 5901，也可连任意 ws://host:port/websockify）、终端（DSH 原生终端里 ssh）与文件目录（浏览/预览/下载/上传无人机的文件系统），并提供状态浮窗（温度与 CPU 两块并列卡片各带动态时间轴曲线，标题栏显示开机时间，可拖动、自动刷新、可调透明度）。",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "vnc-app.html",
    "vnc-connect.html",
    "float.html",
    "novnc"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ssh",
    "robot"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}